      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s residents rely on the Camel Express demand‑response buses, which shuttle riders between La Paz Valley and Quartzsite on weekdays.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
